{"id":"447465","name":"马蹄筒骨汤","author":"maggie-Tiao","authorId":"7826048","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/447465/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"筒骨","amount":"2个"},{"name":"马蹄","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"3片"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"2个"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"20颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"筒骨洗净焯水，放入焖烧锅内胆。","img":"images/447465/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入马蹄，红枣，姜，枸杞，盐。","img":"images/447465/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加水没过食材。","img":"images/447465/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放炉灶煮沸再煮30分钟。","img":"images/447465/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入焖烧锅外锅，盖上盖焖3个钟。","img":"images/447465/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盛出可食！","img":"images/447465/step_6.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：焖烧锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}